The numbers in it that describe the Adreno GPU -- the layout of the command processor's packet headers, the opcodes,
the register offsets and their bitfields, the texture and buffer descriptor words, the sequence of state a compute
dispatch is given -- are taken from Mesa (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa, MIT), and checked against it:

  src/freedreno/registers/adreno/adreno_pm4.xml, a6xx.xml, adreno_common.xml   (and the headers generated from them)
  src/freedreno/common/freedreno_pm4.h                                           (the packet header formulas)
  src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py                                      (what this chip is to Mesa)
  src/freedreno/computerator/a6xx.cc                                             (the order of a compute dispatch)

